{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "mini-Lago API (Numaris-native)",
    "version": "6.0.0",
    "description": "Motor de facturación domain-specific para Numaris.\n\n**Modelo v6:**\n- `Customer` posee el ciclo de facturación: `billing_period_months` (1/3/6/12), `billing_anchor_day` (1-28), y `nonrecurring_trigger` (immediate | next_cycle).\n- `Service.pricing_model`:\n  - `recurring`: renta per_unit cada periodo del customer + setup opcional una vez por unit.\n  - `one_off` (prepago): cuando una unit hace su primer ping, se cobra **1 vez** setup (si aplica) + **N mensualidades por adelantado** (N = `unit.prepaid_months` ?? `service.prepaid_months_default`). La unit queda marcada y no vuelve a aparecer en facturas.\n- `Unit` materializada. `setup_billed_at` (recurring) y `oneoff_billed_at` (one_off) gating.\n- `Invoice`:\n  - Cycle invoice (cron auto-billing + POST /invoices manual): agrega fees de todos los services recurring (+ one_offs nuevos si trigger=next_cycle) + customer add-ons.\n  - One-off immediate invoice: POST /events emite automáticamente 1 invoice con 2 líneas (setup + N mensualidades) por la unit que acaba de aparecer.\n- `Fee.kind ∈ {monthly, setup, service_addon, customer_addon, one_off}`. En el modelo prepago: `setup` es 1 renglón por unit nueva, `one_off` es 1 renglón por unit nueva con `units=N` meses.\n\n**Impuestos**: mini-Lago **NO calcula impuestos**. Los invoices exponen solo `fees_amount_cents` (monto neto). NetSuite calcula IVA/IEPS/retenciones y emite el CFDI. El folio fiscal llega de vuelta vía `/external-confirm`.\n\n**Contrato con NetSuite (v13)**: `customer.external_id` de mini-Lago se usa como `externalId` en NetSuite. Al crear el customer en NetSuite, manda ese mismo string en el campo `externalId`. Cuando NetSuite responda con su `internalId`, persistirlo en mini-Lago vía `PATCH /api/v1/customers/:external_id` con `netsuite_internal_id`. El payload de dispatch construye automáticamente `customer.netsuite_entity_handle` = `<internal_id>` si existe, o `eid:<external_id>` como fallback (NetSuite resuelve por externalId). El consumidor del dispatch usa este campo directamente como `entity: { id: <handle> }` en el POST a NetSuite REST.\n\n**Auth**: Bearer en `/api/v1/*` (excepto health/openapi/discovery). Callbacks NetSuite con HMAC-SHA256.\n\n**Idempotency** en POST /invoices y /credit_notes. POST /events ya es idempotente por `transaction_id`."
  },
  "servers": [
    { "url": "https://billing2-production.up.railway.app", "description": "Railway prod" },
    { "url": "http://localhost:3000", "description": "Local dev" }
  ],
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": { "type": "http", "scheme": "bearer" },
      "NetSuiteSignature": { "type": "apiKey", "in": "header", "name": "X-NetSuite-Signature" }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Error": { "type": "object", "properties": { "status": { "type": "integer" }, "error": { "type": "string" }, "code": { "type": "string" }, "error_details": { "type": "object" } } },
      "Meta": { "type": "object", "properties": { "current_page": { "type": "integer" }, "next_page": { "type": ["integer", "null"] }, "prev_page": { "type": ["integer", "null"] }, "total_pages": { "type": "integer" }, "total_count": { "type": "integer" } } },
      "Customer": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Owns the billing cycle. Has N services and N customer-level flat add-ons.",
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "external_id": { "type": "string" },
          "name": { "type": "string" },
          "currency": { "type": "string" },
          "country": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "timezone": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "applicable_timezone": { "type": "string" },
          "tax_identification_number": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["pending", "active", "terminated"] },
          "billing_period_months": { "type": "integer", "enum": [1, 3, 6, 12], "description": "Largo del ciclo de facturación en meses." },
          "billing_anchor_day": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 28, "description": "Día del mes en que cierra el periodo." },
          "nonrecurring_trigger": { "type": "string", "enum": ["immediate", "next_cycle"], "description": "Cómo se facturan units de services one_off: immediate=1 invoice por ping, next_cycle=acumular hasta el cierre del ciclo." },
          "subscription_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "current_billing_period_started_at": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" },
          "current_billing_period_ending_at": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" },
          "netsuite_internal_id": { "type": ["string", "null"], "description": "v13 — Internal id que NetSuite asignó al customer. Cache opcional. null = mini-Lago no lo conoce; el dispatch usa eid:<external_id> como fallback." },
          "netsuite_entity_handle": { "type": "string", "description": "v13 — Computed. String listo para usar como `entity: { id: <handle> }` en el POST REST de NetSuite. Es `<netsuite_internal_id>` si existe, o `eid:<external_id>` si no. Lo expone tanto el GET del customer como el dispatch payload de invoices." },
          "tax_identification_number_note": { "type": "string", "description": "El RFC del cliente se envía a NetSuite con cada invoice. mini-Lago no calcula impuestos." }
        }
      },
      "CustomerWriteable": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["external_id", "name", "currency"],
        "properties": {
          "external_id": { "type": "string" },
          "name": { "type": "string" },
          "currency": { "type": "string" },
          "country": { "type": "string" },
          "timezone": { "type": "string" },
          "tax_identification_number": { "type": "string" },
          "billing_period_months": { "type": "integer", "enum": [1, 3, 6, 12], "default": 1 },
          "billing_anchor_day": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 28, "default": 1 },
          "nonrecurring_trigger": { "type": "string", "enum": ["immediate", "next_cycle"], "default": "next_cycle" },
          "subscription_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
        }
      },
      "Service": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Owns units + per-unit pricing. Does NOT own the billing cycle (the customer does).",
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "code": { "type": "string" },
          "name": { "type": "string" },
          "customer_id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "currency": { "type": "string" },
          "pricing_model": { "type": "string", "enum": ["recurring", "one_off"], "description": "recurring=renta por periodo + setup opcional. one_off=cargo único por unit cuando aparece." },
          "monthly_unit_amount_cents": { "type": "integer", "description": "Precio mensual /unidad VIGENTE (resuelto al instante de leer). Si hay un pending_price_change con effective_from ya pasado, este campo refleja ese valor promovido." },
          "setup_unit_amount_cents": { "type": "integer", "description": "Setup /unidad VIGENTE (resuelto al instante de leer)." },
          "pending_price_change": {
            "type": ["object", "null"],
            "description": "Cambio de precio programado a futuro (v7). Solo presente cuando hay un cambio con effective_from > ahora. Aplica a recurring (cycle next ≥ effective_from) y a one_off (cycle/ping next ≥ effective_from).",
            "properties": {
              "monthly_unit_amount_cents": { "type": "integer" },
              "setup_unit_amount_cents": { "type": "integer" },
              "effective_from": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
            }
          },
          "prepaid_months_default": { "type": ["integer", "null"], "description": "Solo one_off: default de meses prepagados por unit. Sobreescribible por unit en POST /events o POST /units (campo prepaid_months)." },
          "netsuite_monthly_item_code": { "type": ["string", "null"], "description": "v9 — Código del item NetSuite al que se mapean los fees kind=monthly (recurring) Y los fees kind=one_off (mensualidades prepagadas de un service one_off — conceptualmente la misma renta mensual cobrada por anticipado). null = no configurado." },
          "netsuite_setup_item_code": { "type": ["string", "null"], "description": "v9 — Código NetSuite para fees kind=setup. Aplica si setup_unit_amount_cents > 0." },
          "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["active", "terminated"] }
        }
      },
      "ServiceWriteable": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["code", "name", "customer_external_id"],
        "properties": {
          "code": { "type": "string" },
          "name": { "type": "string" },
          "customer_external_id": { "type": "string" },
          "currency": { "type": "string" },
          "pricing_model": { "type": "string", "enum": ["recurring", "one_off"], "default": "recurring" },
          "monthly_unit_amount_cents": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
          "setup_unit_amount_cents": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
          "prepaid_months_default": { "type": ["integer", "null"], "minimum": 1, "description": "Solo para one_off — meses prepagados por defecto por unit." },
          "netsuite_monthly_item_code": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "netsuite_setup_item_code": { "type": ["string", "null"] }
        }
      },
      "ServiceAddOn": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Per-unit recurring modifier attached to a Service. Genera 1 fee 'service_addon' por invoice mientras esté activo.",
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "service_id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "code": { "type": "string" },
          "name": { "type": "string" },
          "pricing_type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["per_unit_monthly"], "description": "Solo per_unit_monthly en v3." },
          "amount_cents": { "type": "integer" },
          "netsuite_item_code": { "type": ["string", "null"], "description": "v9 — código NetSuite del item al que se mapean los fees service_addon de este add-on." },
          "active_from": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "active_to": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" },
          "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["active", "terminated"] }
        }
      },
      "CustomerAddOn": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Flat recurring modifier attached to a Customer (independiente de services y units).",
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "customer_id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "code": { "type": "string" },
          "name": { "type": "string" },
          "pricing_type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["flat_monthly"] },
          "amount_cents": { "type": "integer" },
          "netsuite_item_code": { "type": ["string", "null"], "description": "v9 — código NetSuite del item al que se mapea el fee customer_addon." },
          "active_from": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "active_to": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" },
          "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["active", "terminated"] }
        }
      },
      "Unit": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "service_id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "external_id": { "type": "string" },
          "label": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "active_from": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time", "description": "Cuándo empezó a reportar / existir la unit (verdad operativa)." },
          "active_to": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" },
          "billing_starts_at": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time", "description": "v8 — Override de fecha de facturación. Si null, el motor usa active_from. Útil para migración desde otra plataforma: cobrar mes completo aunque entre mid-mes (billing_starts_at = inicio del mes) o saltarse el primer mes ya pagado (billing_starts_at = inicio del próximo mes). Aplica a proration de monthly + gate de setup + filtro one_off+next_cycle. En POST /events (one_off+immediate): si billing_starts_at > event timestamp, no se emite invoice en el ping." },
          "setup_billed_at": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" },
          "oneoff_billed_at": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time", "description": "Si está set, la unit ya fue cobrada en un service one_off y no genera más fees." },
          "prepaid_months": { "type": ["integer", "null"], "minimum": 1, "description": "Solo aplica si el service es one_off. Sobreescribe service.prepaid_months_default." },
          "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["active", "terminated"] }
        }
      },
      "InvoiceWriteable": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["customer_external_id"],
        "properties": {
          "customer_external_id": { "type": "string" },
          "period_from": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "period_to": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
          "metadata": { "type": "object", "properties": { "idempotency_key": { "type": "string" } } }
        }
      },
      "Invoice": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Per Customer per Period. Agrega fees de TODOS los services + customer add-ons del customer.",
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "sequential_id": { "type": "integer" },
          "number": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
          "customer_id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["calculated", "finalized", "voided"] },
          "external_dispatch_status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["pending", "dispatched", "confirmed", "failed"] },
          "currency": { "type": "string" },
          "fees_amount_cents": { "type": "integer", "description": "Monto neto sin impuestos. NetSuite agrega los taxes al emitir el CFDI." },
          "period_from": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" },
          "period_to": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "date-time" },
          "fees": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Fee" } },
          "units_annex": { "type": "array" }
        }
      },
      "Fee": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "service_id": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "uuid" },
          "service_add_on_id": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "uuid" },
          "customer_add_on_id": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "uuid" },
          "kind": { "type": "string", "enum": ["monthly", "setup", "service_addon", "customer_addon", "one_off"] },
          "description": { "type": "string" },
          "units": { "type": "string" },
          "unit_amount_cents": { "type": "integer" },
          "amount_cents": { "type": "integer", "description": "Monto neto sin impuestos." },
          "billed_units_detail": { "type": "array" }
        }
      },
      "CreditNoteWriteable": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["invoice_id", "reason", "items"],
        "properties": {
          "invoice_id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" },
          "reason": { "type": "string", "enum": ["duplicated_charge", "product_unsatisfactory", "order_change", "order_cancellation", "fraudulent_charge", "other"] },
          "description": { "type": "string" },
          "credit_amount_cents": { "type": "integer" },
          "items": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "object", "required": ["fee_id", "amount_cents"], "properties": { "fee_id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" }, "amount_cents": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 } } } }
        }
      },
      "ExternalConfirmInvoice": { "type": "object", "required": ["external_invoice"], "properties": { "external_invoice": { "type": "object", "required": ["folio"], "properties": { "folio": { "type": "string" }, "uuid_cfdi": { "type": "string" }, "system": { "type": "string" }, "issued_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" } } } } },
      "ExternalConfirmCreditNote": { "type": "object", "required": ["external_credit_note"], "properties": { "external_credit_note": { "type": "object", "required": ["folio"], "properties": { "folio": { "type": "string" }, "uuid_cfdi": { "type": "string" }, "system": { "type": "string" } } } } }
    }
  },
  "security": [{ "BearerAuth": [] }],
  "paths": {
    "/health": { "get": { "summary": "Health check", "security": [], "tags": ["meta"], "responses": { "200": { "description": "OK" } } } },
    "/openapi.json": { "get": { "summary": "OpenAPI spec", "security": [], "tags": ["meta"], "responses": { "200": { "description": "JSON" } } } },
    "/api/v1": { "get": { "summary": "Endpoint discovery", "security": [], "tags": ["meta"], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Lista" } } } },

    "/api/v1/customers": {
      "post": { "summary": "Create / upsert customer (con billing_time + subscription_at)", "tags": ["customers"], "requestBody": { "required": true, "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "customer": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CustomerWriteable" } } } } } }, "responses": { "200": { "description": "Customer" } } },
      "get": { "summary": "List customers", "tags": ["customers"], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Lista" } } }
    },
    "/api/v1/customers/{externalId}": {
      "get": { "summary": "Read customer", "tags": ["customers"], "parameters": [{ "name": "externalId", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Customer" } } },
      "patch": {
        "summary": "Edita soft fields del customer (v12) — name, email, dirección, etc.",
        "description": "Edita campos NO billing-impacting. Para subscription_at, anchor_day, period_months o nonrecurring_trigger usar PATCH /:externalId/billing-schedule (v11). currency tiene gate: 409 si hay invoices no-voided (cambiar moneda con invoices viejas corrompe reportes). timezone se valida contra IANA. Customer terminated → 409.",
        "tags": ["customers"],
        "parameters": [{ "name": "externalId", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "customer": { "type": "object", "properties": {
            "name": { "type": "string" },
            "email": { "type": ["string", "null"], "format": "email" },
            "phone": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
            "tax_identification_number": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
            "address_line1": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
            "address_line2": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
            "city": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
            "state": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
            "zipcode": { "type": ["string", "null"] },
            "country": { "type": ["string", "null"], "description": "ISO 2 letras" },
            "timezone": { "type": ["string", "null"], "description": "IANA timezone" },
            "currency": { "type": "string", "description": "ISO 3 letras. Solo editable si NO hay invoices no-voided." },
            "netsuite_internal_id": { "type": ["string", "null"], "description": "v13 — Cache del internal id que NetSuite asignó. String vacío o whitespace se normaliza a null." },
            "metadata": { "type": "object" }
          } } } } } }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": { "description": "Customer actualizado" },
          "404": { "description": "Customer no existe" },
          "409": { "description": "customer_terminated | customer_has_invoices (al cambiar currency)" },
          "422": { "description": "Validación: use_billing_schedule_endpoint (si se envían hard fields), invalid_iana, must_not_be_empty, at_least_one_field_required" }
        }
      },
      "delete": { "summary": "Delete (409 si tiene services activos)", "tags": ["customers"], "parameters": [{ "name": "externalId", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "OK" } } }
    },
    "/api/v1/customers/{externalId}/billing-schedule": {
      "patch": {
        "summary": "Edita el calendario de facturación del customer post-creación (v11)",
        "description": "Permite cambiar subscription_at / billing_anchor_day / billing_period_months / nonrecurring_trigger después de crear el customer. Los 3 primeros están gateados por 'sin invoices no-voided' — si las hay, 409. nonrecurring_trigger es siempre editable. Tras actualizar, currentBillingPeriodStartedAt/EndingAt se recalculan automáticamente. Si el nuevo subscription_at es futuro, el customer pasa a status='pending'. El histórico se guarda en customer.metadata.schedule_history (append-only, últimas 50 ediciones).",
        "tags": ["customers"],
        "parameters": [{ "name": "externalId", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "billing_schedule": { "type": "object", "properties": {
            "subscription_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" },
            "billing_anchor_day": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 28 },
            "billing_period_months": { "type": "integer", "enum": [1, 3, 6, 12] },
            "nonrecurring_trigger": { "type": "string", "enum": ["immediate", "next_cycle"] }
          } } } } } }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": { "description": "Customer actualizado" },
          "404": { "description": "Customer no existe" },
          "409": { "description": "customer_terminated | customer_has_invoices (con blocking_invoice_count)" },
          "422": { "description": "Validación: at_least_one_field_required, must_be_1_to_28, must_be_1_3_6_or_12, value_is_invalid, invalid_iso_datetime" }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/customers/{externalId}/add-ons": {
      "post": { "summary": "Create customer-level flat add-on", "tags": ["add-ons"], "parameters": [{ "name": "externalId", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }], "requestBody": { "required": true, "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "customer_add_on": { "type": "object", "required": ["code", "name", "amount_cents"], "properties": { "code": { "type": "string" }, "name": { "type": "string" }, "description": { "type": "string" }, "amount_cents": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }, "active_from": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" } } } } } } } }, "responses": { "200": { "description": "CustomerAddOn", "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "customer_add_on": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CustomerAddOn" } } } } } } } },
      "get": { "summary": "List customer add-ons", "tags": ["add-ons"], "parameters": [{ "name": "externalId", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Lista" } } }
    },
    "/api/v1/customer-add-ons/{id}": {
      "get": { "summary": "Read customer add-on", "tags": ["add-ons"], "parameters": [{ "name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "CustomerAddOn" } } },
      "patch": { "summary": "Update (code is immutable)", "tags": ["add-ons"], "parameters": [{ "name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "CustomerAddOn" } } },
      "delete": { "summary": "Soft-terminate (active_to = now)", "tags": ["add-ons"], "parameters": [{ "name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Terminated" } } }
    },

    "/api/v1/services": {
      "post": { "summary": "Create service (sin billing fields — heredados del customer)", "tags": ["services"], "requestBody": { "required": true, "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "service": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ServiceWriteable" } } } } } }, "responses": { "200": { "description": "Service" } } },
      "get": { "summary": "List services", "tags": ["services"], "parameters": [{ "name": "customer_external_id", "in": "query", "schema": { "type": "string" } }, { "name": "status", "in": "query", "schema": { "type": "string" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Lista" } } }
    },
    "/api/v1/services/{code}": {
      "get": { "summary": "Read service", "tags": ["services"], "parameters": [{ "name": "code", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Service" } } },
      "patch": { "summary": "Update name/description/metadata + códigos NetSuite (v9). NO toca precios — usa PUT /price.", "tags": ["services"], "parameters": [{ "name": "code", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }], "requestBody": { "required": true, "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "service": { "type": "object", "properties": { "name": { "type": "string" }, "description": { "type": ["string", "null"] }, "netsuite_monthly_item_code": { "type": ["string", "null"] }, "netsuite_setup_item_code": { "type": ["string", "null"] }, "metadata": { "type": "object" } } } } } } } }, "responses": { "200": { "description": "Service actualizado" } } },
      "delete": { "summary": "Delete (409 si tiene fees — usa terminate)", "tags": ["services"], "parameters": [{ "name": "code", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "OK" } } }
    },
    "/api/v1/invoices/preview": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Vista previa (dry-run) de cycle invoice — no persiste nada",
        "description": "Computa exactamente lo que /api/v1/invoices produciría (fees, units_annex, payload a NetSuite) SIN crear invoice, SIN crear fees, SIN marcar units como facturadas, SIN incrementar contadores y SIN dispatchar. Re-ejecutable infinitas veces. Acepta override de periodo (period_from + period_to) y de `now` (para simular qué pasaría si hoy fuera X — útil con cambios de precio programados v7).",
        "tags": ["invoices"],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "invoice": { "type": "object", "required": ["customer_external_id"], "properties": { "customer_external_id": { "type": "string" }, "period_from": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }, "period_to": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }, "now": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time", "description": "Simula que la hora actual es X. Si no hay override de periodo, este valor se usa como reference para calcular el ciclo vigente. También determina el precio efectivo para pings one_off + immediate." } } } } } } }
        },
        "responses": { "200": { "description": "Preview con fees + units_annex + netsuite_payload" }, "404": { "description": "Customer no existe" }, "422": { "description": "Validación (period_from/to incompletos, fechas inválidas, etc.)" } }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/services/{code}/terminate": { "post": { "summary": "Terminate service + sus units activas", "tags": ["services"], "parameters": [{ "name": "code", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Service terminated" } } } },
    "/api/v1/services/{code}/price": {
      "put": {
        "summary": "Programar cambio de precio con vigencia desde el siguiente ciclo (v7)",
        "description": "Aplica a recurring y one_off. El nuevo precio se usa cuando el periodStart del cycle invoice (o el timestamp del ping immediate) sea on-or-after effective_from. Clientes mid-cycle mantienen el precio viejo hasta su cierre. Si ya existe un pending sin vencer, se sobreescribe. Si el pending existente ya está en vigor, se promueve a base antes de escribir el nuevo.",
        "tags": ["services"],
        "parameters": [{ "name": "code", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "price": { "type": "object", "required": ["monthly_unit_amount_cents", "setup_unit_amount_cents", "effective_from"], "properties": { "monthly_unit_amount_cents": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }, "setup_unit_amount_cents": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }, "effective_from": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time", "description": "Debe ser futuro (> ahora)." } } } } } } }
        },
        "responses": { "200": { "description": "Service con pending_price_change" }, "409": { "description": "service_terminated" }, "422": { "description": "Validación (must_be_in_the_future, must_be_non_negative_integer, etc.)" } }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/services/{code}/pending-price": {
      "delete": {
        "summary": "Cancelar un cambio de precio programado (v7)",
        "description": "Solo tiene éxito si effective_from > ahora. Si el cambio ya entró en vigor, devuelve 409 (la única forma de revertirlo es programar otro cambio en sentido opuesto).",
        "tags": ["services"],
        "parameters": [{ "name": "code", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }],
        "responses": { "200": { "description": "Service con pending_price_change=null" }, "409": { "description": "no_pending_price_change | pending_price_already_in_effect" } }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/services/{code}/add-ons": {
      "post": { "summary": "Create service-level per-unit add-on", "tags": ["add-ons"], "parameters": [{ "name": "code", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }], "requestBody": { "required": true, "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "service_add_on": { "type": "object", "required": ["code", "name", "amount_cents"], "properties": { "code": { "type": "string" }, "name": { "type": "string" }, "description": { "type": "string" }, "amount_cents": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }, "active_from": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" } } } } } } } }, "responses": { "200": { "description": "ServiceAddOn", "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "service_add_on": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ServiceAddOn" } } } } } } } },
      "get": { "summary": "List service add-ons", "tags": ["add-ons"], "parameters": [{ "name": "code", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Lista" } } }
    },
    "/api/v1/service-add-ons/{id}": {
      "get": { "summary": "Read service add-on", "tags": ["add-ons"], "parameters": [{ "name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "ServiceAddOn" } } },
      "patch": { "summary": "Update (code is immutable)", "tags": ["add-ons"], "parameters": [{ "name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "ServiceAddOn" } } },
      "delete": { "summary": "Soft-terminate", "tags": ["add-ons"], "parameters": [{ "name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Terminated" } } }
    },

    "/api/v1/units": {
      "post": { "summary": "Create unit", "tags": ["units"], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Unit" } } },
      "get": { "summary": "List units", "tags": ["units"], "parameters": [{ "name": "service_code", "in": "query", "schema": { "type": "string" } }, { "name": "status", "in": "query", "schema": { "type": "string", "enum": ["active", "terminated"] } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Lista" } } }
    },
    "/api/v1/units/{id}": {
      "get": { "summary": "Read unit", "tags": ["units"], "parameters": [{ "name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Unit" } } },
      "patch": { "summary": "Update label / active_to / billing_starts_at", "tags": ["units"], "parameters": [{ "name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Unit" } } }
    },
    "/api/v1/units/{id}/migrate": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Migración de plan: terminate-and-recreate atómico (v8)",
        "description": "Cierra la unit en su service actual (activeTo = migration_at) y crea una nueva unit en `to_service_code` con el mismo external_id. Política: solo a futuro, mismo customer, mismo pricing_model. Por default NO cobra setup del plan nuevo (setupBilledAt se preestablece en la nueva unit). Add-ons per-unit del service viejo se cierran junto con la unit vieja. Audit: metadata.migrated_to (vieja) + metadata.migrated_from (nueva) + EventLog operation_type='migrate'. Tras la migración, eventos al service viejo con ese external_id son rechazados (422).",
        "tags": ["units"],
        "parameters": [{ "name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "migration": { "type": "object", "required": ["to_service_code", "migration_at"], "properties": {
            "to_service_code": { "type": "string", "description": "Code del service destino (mismo customer, mismo pricing_model, distinto al actual)." },
            "migration_at": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time", "description": "Cuándo entra en vigor. Debe ser > ahora." },
            "charge_new_setup": { "type": "boolean", "default": false, "description": "Si true, deja setupBilledAt=null en la unit nueva (se cobrará setup del plan nuevo en el próximo cycle). Default false." },
            "new_label": { "type": ["string", "null"], "description": "Label opcional para la unit nueva. Si se omite, se hereda el label viejo." },
            "metadata": { "type": "object", "description": "Metadata adicional para la unit nueva (se combina con migrated_from)." }
          } } } } } }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": { "description": "OK", "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "old_unit": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Unit" }, "new_unit": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Unit" }, "event_id": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } } } } } },
          "404": { "description": "unit | to_service no existe" },
          "409": { "description": "unit_terminated | unit_already_migrated | external_id_collision_on_target" },
          "422": { "description": "Validación (must_be_in_the_future, must_be_same_customer, must_be_same_pricing_model, same_as_current_service, service_terminated)" }
        }
      }
    },

    "/api/v1/events": {
      "post": { "summary": "POST event (add/remove unit) — materializa unit. El payload acepta `prepaid_months` opcional para overrides en services one_off. Si la unit pertenece a un service one_off de un customer con trigger=immediate, también emite invoice individual con setup + N mensualidades, y la response incluye `triggered_invoice_id`.", "tags": ["events"], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Event (+ triggered_invoice_id si aplicó)" } } },
      "get": { "summary": "Event log (audit)", "tags": ["events"], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Lista" } } }
    },

    "/api/v1/invoices": {
      "post": { "summary": "Calcular invoice del customer (incluye TODOS sus services + customer add-ons)", "tags": ["invoices"], "parameters": [{ "name": "Idempotency-Key", "in": "header", "schema": { "type": "string" } }], "requestBody": { "required": true, "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "invoice": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/InvoiceWriteable" } } } } } }, "responses": { "200": { "description": "Invoice" } } },
      "get": { "summary": "List invoices", "tags": ["invoices"], "parameters": [{ "name": "customer_external_id", "in": "query", "schema": { "type": "string" } }, { "name": "status", "in": "query", "schema": { "type": "string" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Lista" } } }
    },
    "/api/v1/invoices/{id}": { "get": { "summary": "Read invoice", "tags": ["invoices"], "parameters": [{ "name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Invoice" } } } },
    "/api/v1/invoices/{id}/void": { "post": { "summary": "Void invoice", "tags": ["invoices"], "parameters": [{ "name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "OK" } } } },
    "/api/v1/invoices/{id}/external-confirm": { "post": { "summary": "Callback NetSuite (HMAC)", "tags": ["external-confirm"], "security": [{ "NetSuiteSignature": [] }], "parameters": [{ "name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }], "requestBody": { "required": true, "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ExternalConfirmInvoice" } } } }, "responses": { "200": { "description": "Finalized" } } } },

    "/api/v1/credit_notes": {
      "post": { "summary": "Create credit note (invoice debe estar finalized+confirmed)", "tags": ["credit_notes"], "requestBody": { "required": true, "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "properties": { "credit_note": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreditNoteWriteable" } } } } } }, "responses": { "200": { "description": "CN" } } },
      "get": { "summary": "List credit notes", "tags": ["credit_notes"], "responses": { "200": { "description": "Lista" } } }
    },
    "/api/v1/credit_notes/{id}": { "get": { "summary": "Read credit note", "tags": ["credit_notes"], "parameters": [{ "name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }], "responses": { "200": { "description": "CN" } } } },
    "/api/v1/credit_notes/{id}/external-confirm": { "post": { "summary": "Callback NetSuite CN", "tags": ["external-confirm"], "security": [{ "NetSuiteSignature": [] }], "parameters": [{ "name": "id", "in": "path", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string", "format": "uuid" } }], "requestBody": { "required": true, "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ExternalConfirmCreditNote" } } } }, "responses": { "200": { "description": "Finalized" } } } },

    "/api/v1/admin/reset": { "post": { "summary": "Hard reset (wipea data, preserva org)", "tags": ["admin"], "parameters": [{ "name": "X-Admin-Reset-Token", "in": "header", "required": true, "schema": { "type": "string" } }], "requestBody": { "required": true, "content": { "application/json": { "schema": { "type": "object", "required": ["confirm"], "properties": { "confirm": { "type": "string" } } } } } }, "responses": { "200": { "description": "OK" } } } }
  }
}
